    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady is delighted to bring to the market this excellent 4-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home with South-Facing Rear Garden.\nSet within a popular and well-established residential development on Drogheda's Northside, this impressive 4-bedroom semi-detached home offers approximately 106 sq. m. of well-proportioned living accommodation and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\nThe property provides bright, spacious accommodation, making it an ideal choice for families or first-time buyers.\nThe property features a large, south-facing rear garden, offering an excellent private outdoor space. \nThe location is particularly convenient, with a wide range of local amenities close by, including schools, shops, services and recreational facilities. Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, Drogheda town centre and a host of primary and secondary schools are all within easy reach.\nAccommodation includes: Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, downstairs w.c., 4 Bedrooms and a family Bathroom\nOverall, this is a superb opportunity to acquire a well-maintained four-bedroom family home in a highly sought-after location, combining spacious accommodation, excellent condition and a fantastic south-facing garden.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
